              "title": "A value is built into SQL query text",
              "summary": "Refactor the string-built query to keep values separate from SQL structure using the verified driver API. This construction is a poor-practice finding even when an exploitable injection has not been demonstrated. Field validation is a separate concern.",
              "input_validation": "No validator call was identified for the named field in the analyzed handler and modeled middleware. This does not prove that every execution path lacks validation. Evidence: req.body.email reaches a sensitive use with no validator call in the handler or applicable middleware The value reaches a call or middleware whose validation effect has not been established. Inspect the actual check and whether it runs before this use. Evidence: a call receives req.body.password before the sink, and that call is not a proven validator",
