          "message": {
            "text": "GET /rest/user/change-password: Credential in the URL query is written to access logs [poor_practice]. The route reads a credential from the URL query string, and request logging registered before the route records the full URL. Send the credential in the request body (for example with POST) instead of the URL, and keep query strings out of access logs for sensitive routes. Logging evidence: request query field current reaches credential evidence \"security.hash(currentPassword) !== loggedInUser.data.password\" and the URL with its query string is recorded by request logging ('combined'); request query field new reaches credential evidence \"password: newPasswordInString\" and the URL with its query string is recorded by request logging ('combined')."
          },
