              }
            }
          ],
          "message": {
            "text": "AboutComponent: API response reaches browser output; origin link needs review [needs_review]. A client HTTP response reaches rendering. Link the producing route, response field and source/write origin before judging cross-tier XSS. Default Angular sanitization is expected for plain values, but the return type/transformations of this value are not established; a trusted wrapper cannot be excluded."
          },
